# Canonical OpenSpec specs may only change via `bunx openspec archive`
# (enforced by .github/workflows/openspec.yml's canonical-guard job) while
# any openspec/changes/*/specs/ delta is active. Reformatting these directly
# would trip that guard. Remove this entry and reformat once no active
# change has a pending specs/ delta (sm-hohu).
openspec/specs/

# Prettier only auto-reads the root .gitignore, not nested ones, so
# .beads/.gitignore's runtime-file entries (backup/, embeddeddolt/,
# export-state.json, etc.) aren't picked up automatically. These are bd's
# own runtime state, never authored content, so ignore the whole directory.
.beads/
